<!--
    Cartridge NAND types are provisional: capacities match the dumps, and the Toshiba
    IDs are accepted by the boot firmware. PCB chip markings need verification.
    Some dumps have blank spare areas; others contain spare data of unknown format.
    Photographed cartridges have 24C08 EEPROMs. All current slot configurations use
    24C08; EEPROM types on the remaining PCBs and factory contents need verification.

    The following are known to exist but not dumped

    Crazy Mix 1
    Gold Miner Joe
    Gormiti 3 episodi
    Gormiti: Agguato nella Valle
    MP3 Player
    Power Rangers SPD
    Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles + 5 Atari Games
    Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles 1
    Winx Club 2

    The following were cancelled, prototypes may exist

    Activision Anthology
    Freddi Fish and the Case of the Missing Kelp Seeds
    SparkBlast
    The Fast and the Furious & 2 Fast 2 Furious
    Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 4
    Truckz
    X2: Wolverine's Revenge
    Das Magische Labyrinth (maybe released)

-->
